OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GAl Ryan reaches the climax of his
OL,6,     Gweek focused on performances of
OL,7,     Gdistinctive settings of the mass
OL,8,     Gwith Beethoven, and he also casts
OL,9,     Gan eye on festive chamber music
OL,10,     Gfrom Belfast.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Sibelius
OL,12,     GKate Molleson follows Sibelius in
OL,13,     Gthe creation of his Sixth and
OL,14,     GSeventh Symphonies - and also the
OL,15,     GEighth which the composer
OL,16,     Gdestroyed.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GHarpist Anne-Sophie Bertrand and
OL,19,     Grediscovered pieces by Ethel
OL,20,     GYeats and Augusta Zuckermann, who
OL,21,     Gwas known by her pseudonym Mana-
OL,22,     GZucca.
